Subject: [PATCH] brace log macro used as a match arm expression

zune-core's no-op log stubs (feature "log" off) expand to nothing, which is
not a valid expression in match-arm position. Make the arm a block with a
statement so the empty expansion is valid.
---
diff --git a/crates/zune-bmp/src/decoder.rs b/crates/zune-bmp/src/decoder.rs
index 0f7b0cd..f92fac6 100644
--- a/crates/zune-bmp/src/decoder.rs
+++ b/crates/zune-bmp/src/decoder.rs
@@ -1014,7 +1014,7 @@ where
                         pix.swap(0, 2);
                     }
                 }
-                _ => error!("Unhandled pixel format")
+                _ => { error!("Unhandled pixel format"); }
             }
             self.image_in_bgra = true;
         }
